              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kavuteni wa nguthu ya asũvĩi oosa mũthembi mũnene Selaia, na Nzevania mũthembi wa kelĩ, na ala asũvĩi atatũ ma mwalyonĩ: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
