          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ũndũ wa lĩu wake, kwaĩ lĩu wa mavinda onthe wanengawe nĩ mũsumbĩ wa Mbaviloni, kĩla mũthenya lĩu kũvika mũthenya wa kũkw’a kwake, mĩthenya yonthe ya thayũ wake.",
          "type": "text",
